{"seq":1,"slug":"kernel-functions","title":"核函数选择：为什么选哪个几乎无所谓","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/kernel-density-estimation/kernels/kernel-functions","wordCount":1418,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"核函数选择-为什么选哪个几乎无所谓\">核函数选择：为什么选哪个几乎无所谓</h1><p>新手用 KDE 常把大量精力花在纠结「该用高斯核还是 Epanechnikov 核」，这几乎是把力气用错了地方。<a href=\"../foundations/kde-model\">KDE 定义</a> 里的 AMISE 已经透露了结论：核函数只通过两个积分常数进入误差公式，不同核之间的渐近效率差距不到 7%。这一篇把常见核列全、把「效率」这个概念讲清，然后告诉你在什么少数情况下核的选择才真正值得在意。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>本篇要传达一个反直觉但重要的事实：核函数选哪个几乎无所谓。三条线索——常见核的清单与性质、核在 AMISE 里唯一的入口（效率因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(K)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，最差核也仅需多约 7.5% 样本）、以及核真正影响的实用性质（光滑性、可截断性、尾部行为）。结论是默认高斯核，把力气留给带宽。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见核函数一览\">常见核函数一览</h2><p>核函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K(u)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 只需非负、对称、积分为一。满足这些条件的函数无穷多，实践中常用的就那么几个。下表按支撑集是否有界分组，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{1}(\\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为示性函数。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>核</th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K(u)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>支撑集</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>高斯 (Gaussian)</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}}e^{-u^2/2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.5249em;vertical-align:-0.538em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.551em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord sqrt mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9128em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8728em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail mtight\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1272em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.538em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9869em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-\\infty,\\infty)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>处处光滑，无穷可微，最常用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Epanechnikov</td>\n<td>$\\frac{3}{4}(1-u^2)\\mathbf{1}(</td>\n<td>u</td>\n<td>\\le 1)$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三角 (Triangular)</td>\n<td>$(1-</td>\n<td>u</td>\n<td>)\\mathbf{1}(</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双权 (Biweight)</td>\n<td>$\\frac{15}{16}(1-u^2)^2\\mathbf{1}(</td>\n<td>u</td>\n<td>\\le 1)$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>均匀 (Uniform)</td>\n<td>$\\frac12\\mathbf{1}(</td>\n<td>u</td>\n<td>\\le 1)$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>余弦 (Cosine)</td>\n<td>$\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\cos(\\frac{\\pi}{2}u)\\mathbf{1}(</td>\n<td>u</td>\n<td>\\le 1)$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>scikit-learn 的 <code>KernelDensity</code>（1.9.0）内置 6 种核：gaussian、tophat、epanechnikov、exponential、linear、cosine；statsmodels 的 <code>KDEUnivariate</code> 提供 7 种。可见工具层面选核只是改一个字符串参数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"效率-amise-里核的唯一入口\">效率：AMISE 里核的唯一入口</h2><p>回顾最优 MISE 的推导，把最优带宽代回 AMISE 后，核对误差的全部贡献浓缩成一个量——核效率因子</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(K) = \\mu_2(K)^{2/5}\\, R(K)^{4/5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.188em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2/5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4/5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>K</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu_2(K)=\\int u^2 K\\,du</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1202em;vertical-align:-0.3061em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.1945em;position:relative;top:-0.0006em;\">∫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 是二阶矩，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><msup><mi>K</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R(K)=\\int K^2\\,du</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1202em;vertical-align:-0.3061em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.1945em;position:relative;top:-0.0006em;\">∫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 是粗糙度。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(K)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 越小，同样样本量下 MISE 越小。可以证明，在所有合法核里，Epanechnikov 核使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(K)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 达到最小——它是理论最优核。把其它核的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(K)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 除以 Epanechnikov 的，得到相对效率。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>核</th>\n<th>相对效率</th>\n<th>达到同等精度所需样本量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Epanechnikov</td>\n<td>1.000</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双权</td>\n<td>0.994</td>\n<td>+0.6%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三角</td>\n<td>0.986</td>\n<td>+1.4%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高斯</td>\n<td>0.951</td>\n<td>+5.1%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>余弦</td>\n<td>0.999</td>\n<td>+0.1%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>均匀</td>\n<td>0.930</td>\n<td>+7.5%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键读法：即便是最差的均匀核，也只需比最优核多约 7.5% 的样本就能达到同等精度。高斯核比理论最优只差 5%。这点差距在真实数据的噪声面前完全可以忽略——<strong>带宽选错一点，代价远大于核选错</strong>。带宽才是要认真对待的旋钮，见 <a href=\"bandwidth-selection\">带宽选择</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[选择核函数] --&gt; B[计算 mu2 与 R K]&#10;    B --&gt; C[效率因子 C K]&#10;    C --&gt; D{相对 Epanechnikov}&#10;    D --&gt;|最优| E[Epanechnikov 1.000]&#10;    D --&gt;|次之| F[双权/三角/余弦 差 1% 内]&#10;    D --&gt;|常用| G[高斯 差约 5%]&#10;    D --&gt;|最差| H[均匀 差约 7.5%]&#10;    E --&gt; I[结论: 核几乎无所谓&lt;br/&gt;带宽才是命门]&#10;    G --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; I\">flowchart TD\n    A[选择核函数] --&gt; B[计算 mu2 与 R K]\n    B --&gt; C[效率因子 C K]\n    C --&gt; D{相对 Epanechnikov}\n    D --&gt;|最优| E[Epanechnikov 1.000]\n    D --&gt;|次之| F[双权/三角/余弦 差 1% 内]\n    D --&gt;|常用| G[高斯 差约 5%]\n    D --&gt;|最差| H[均匀 差约 7.5%]\n    E --&gt; I[结论: 核几乎无所谓&lt;br/&gt;带宽才是命门]\n    G --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; I</pre><h2 id=\"那什么时候核真的重要\">那什么时候核真的重要</h2><p>既然效率差距可忽略，为什么高斯核仍是绝大多数场景的默认？因为核的选择影响的不是渐近效率，而是一些实用性质。</p>\n<p><strong>光滑性与可微性</strong>。高斯核无穷可微，估计出的密度处处光滑，对需要梯度的下游任务（Mean-shift 找模态、基于密度梯度做优化）友好；Epanechnikov 在支撑边界 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|u|=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 处导数不连续，密度曲线会有细微折点。若你要对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>f</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1523em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 求导，高斯核省心。</p>\n<p><strong>有界支撑与计算</strong>。Epanechnikov、三角等有界支撑核有一个实际优势：每个查询点只受邻近样本影响，远处样本核值恰为零，这让基于 KD 树的空间剪枝更高效（见 <a href=\"../practice/fast-kde\">快速计算</a>）。高斯核尾部永不为零，理论上每个查询点都要遍历全部样本，只能靠截断近似。</p>\n<p><strong>尾部行为</strong>。高斯核尾部随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{-u^2/2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9869em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9869em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 衰减很快，对重尾数据可能在尾部过度压平；指数核尾部更重，偶尔用于强调尾部。这属于精细调优，多数时候无需操心。一个反直觉但重要的补充：<strong>核阶数</strong>。上述都是二阶核（首个非零矩是二阶矩）；用允许取负值的高阶核可把偏差从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(h^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(h^4)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，但会破坏非负性，实用价值有限，属于理论玩具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实践建议\">实践建议</h2><p>综合下来，选核的决策极其简单：默认高斯核，要空间剪枝加速就换 Epanechnikov，其余情况都别纠结。真正该反复琢磨的是带宽，以及有界数据的边界处理——后者见 <a href=\"boundary-bias\">边界偏差</a>。核的角色，更像是给数据点戴的帽子款式：戴哪顶都遮得住，重要的是帽子有多大。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>合法核只需非负、对称、积分为一；常用高斯、Epanechnikov、三角、双权等，工具里只是一个字符串参数。</li>\n<li>AMISE 里核只通过效率因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>μ</mi><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>5</mn></mrow></msubsup><msup><mi>R</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(K)=\\mu_2^{2/5}R^{4/5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3111em;vertical-align:-0.2663em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4337em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2/5</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2663em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4/5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 进入；Epanechnikov 理论最优，最差的均匀核也仅需多约 7.5% 样本。</li>\n<li>核真正影响的是光滑性（高斯无穷可微）、计算（有界支撑利于剪枝）、尾部行为，而非渐近效率。</li>\n<li>默认高斯核；带宽和边界处理才是值得花力气的地方。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h3><ul>\n<li>真正的命门——带宽如何选：<a href=\"bandwidth-selection\">带宽选择</a></li>\n<li>核为何只通过两个常数进入误差：<a href=\"../foundations/kde-model\">KDE 定义</a></li>\n<li>与此处「密度核」易混的「协方差核」：<a href=\"../../gaussian-processes/kernels/kernel-functions\">高斯过程的核函数</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"核函数选择：为什么选哪个几乎无所谓","id":"核函数选择-为什么选哪个几乎无所谓"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"常见核函数一览","id":"常见核函数一览"},{"level":2,"text":"效率：AMISE 里核的唯一入口","id":"效率-amise-里核的唯一入口"},{"level":2,"text":"那什么时候核真的重要","id":"那什么时候核真的重要"},{"level":2,"text":"实践建议","id":"实践建议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":3,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"KDE 定义：估计量、偏差、方差与 AMISE","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/kernel-density-estimation/foundations/kde-model"},"next":{"title":"带宽选择：KDE 里唯一真正重要的决定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/kernel-density-estimation/kernels/bandwidth-selection"}}